[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0601","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0601.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55427","title":"Coder Coder SSH 配置注入漏洞","description":"Coder 的 `config-ssh` 命令在将服务端提供的 SSH 配置项（`HostnameSuffix`、`SSHConfigOptions`）写入用户 `~/.ssh/config` 文件时，未对嵌入的换行符进行过滤，也未限制可写入的 SSH 指令，导致恶意或已被攻陷的 Coder 服务器可向用户 SSH 配置中注入任意指令（如 `ProxyCommand`）。攻击者利用此漏洞可在开发者执行 `coder config-ssh` 的工作站上以当前用户权限执行任意命令，影响所有通过 Coder 管理远程开发环境的组织。利用条件包括控制服务端配置或中间人攻击，CVSS 评分 8.3，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55427","GHSA-mcqq-fqgf-rxwm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:44:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至以下对应版本：v2.34.2（主线）、v2.33.8、v2.32.7 或 v2.29.17（ESR）。升级后 `HostnameSuffix` 和 `SSHConfigOptions` 将受到严格字符集校验，拒绝换行符等控制字符。如无法立即升级，每次执行 `coder config-ssh` 前先用 `--dry-run` 参数预览输出，确认无异常 SSH 指令后再应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26154","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-mcqq-fqgf-rxwm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55427.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-55427.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-07/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55427.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55427.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55427.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55427.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55427.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/365ac029e77c4cbd9f137b462789ede1e72fd329/data/osv/GO-2026-5913.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/d9ca5e2ef8ba57f2d80ee88fd45a4a5d3bf57b24/posts/cve-2026-55427-go-github-com-coder-coder-v2.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-mcqq-fqgf-rxwm/GHSA-mcqq-fqgf-rxwm.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0601.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0593","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0593.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55079","title":"Coder provisioner 文件上传无界内存分配拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Coder 的 provisionersdk/proto/dataupload.go 中的 NewDataBuilder 函数在分配字节切片时未对客户端提供的 FileSize 参数进行上限校验。已认证的攻击者可通过向 provisioner 守护进程服务端点发送一个约 50 字节的 DataUpload 消息，声明极大的 FileSize（如 1 TiB），触发 Go 运行时内存耗尽导致 coderd 进程崩溃，造成整个部署服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Coder v2.24.0 至 v2.29.7、v2.32.7、v2.33.8、v2.34.2 版本，CVSS 评分 4.9，危害等级中危。官方已在 v2.29.17、v2.32.7、v2.33.8、v2.34.2 版本中通过限制 FileSize 上限为 100 MiB 修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55079","GHSA-f962-qm93-mj4c"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T00:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:44:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至以下已修复版本：v2.34.2、v2.33.8、v2.32.7 或 v2.29.17（ESR）。升级后 `FileSize` 将被限制在 100 MiB 以内，防止无界内存分配导致的 OOM 崩溃。如无法立即升级，可将 provisioner daemon serve 端点的访问权限限制为受信任的 provisioner daemon 服务账户，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25710","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-f962-qm93-mj4c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55079.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55079.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7cbd46ac4e2574be115c8b4e081aab80c1276132/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55079.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55079.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55079.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/49e980b0fa2abb924c0c6216ee3d787ba6a54723/data/reports/GO-2026-5911.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-f962-qm93-mj4c/GHSA-f962-qm93-mj4c.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55079.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/midnightconman/go_vulndb/blob/d993e2e5e84dd30ceb1958dc17e25f002fffd6f7/ID/GO-2026-5911.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0593.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0001","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0001.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"mistune HTMLRenderer.safe_url() 百分号编码绕过导致跨站脚本漏洞","description":"mistune 是 Hsiaoming Yang 开发的 Python Markdown 解析库，其 HTML 渲染器中的 safe_url() 函数用于过滤危险协议（javascript:、data:、vbscript: 等）。该函数在检测协议前缀时未先对 URL 进行百分号解码，导致攻击者可以通过将协议名称中的字符进行百分号编码（如将 javascript: 编码为 javascript%3A）绕过安全过滤。当浏览器解析被绕过后的链接时，会自动解码百分号编码并执行恶意脚本，造成跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。攻击者无需身份认证，只需在评论系统、Wiki 等可提交 Markdown 内容的平台中提交含有恶意编码链接的内容，即可诱导用户点击后执行任意 JavaScript 代码，导致会话劫持、凭证窃取或帐户接管等严重后果。该漏洞影响 mistune 3.2.1 及之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10057356","GHSA-8ppg-4vv7-9p53","GHSA-jxhr-4j38-fpxg"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-08T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 mistune 至 3.3.0 或更高版本。该版本已在 safe_url() 函数中对 URL 先执行 urllib.parse.unquote() 百分号解码再检查协议前缀，阻止编码绕过攻击。临时缓解措施：在应用层过滤用户提交的 Markdown 内容，检查并拦截包含 jav%61script、data%3A、vbscri%70t 等编码协议模式的链接；或在 WAF 中添加规则，对含有百分号编码的危险协议关键词的请求进行阻断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-8ppg-4vv7-9p53","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-jxhr-4j38-fpxg"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0592","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0592.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55078","title":"Coder Coder zip上传解压缺失总量限制拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Coder 远程开发环境平台的 `POST /api/v2/files` 接口在处理 ZIP 文件上传时，通过 `CreateTarFromZip` 在内存中将 ZIP 转换为 TAR，虽限制单条目大小但缺失解压后总数据量聚合限制，导致解压数据写入无界内存缓冲区。已认证攻击者可上传符合 100 MiB 上传限制但包含大量高压缩比条目的 ZIP 文件，解压后耗尽内存导致 `coderd` 服务在 RBAC 权限检查前崩溃，重复请求可致服务持续不可用。该漏洞属拒绝服务（CWE-409），不涉及数据泄露或代码执行。影响 Coder 2.17.0 至 2.29.7、2.32.7、2.33.8、2.34.2 前版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 6.5（中危，AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H）。官方已在 v2.29.17、v2.32.7、v2.33.8、v2.34.2 修复，新增元数据预检聚合大小限制及流式写入强制限制。缓解措施为限制文件上传权限或部署反向代理限制请求体大小。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55078","GHSA-2mg2-p7r7-g27f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T23:16:55Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:45:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Coder 到修复版本：2.29 线升级至 v2.29.17，2.32 线升级至 v2.32.7，2.33 线升级至 v2.33.8，2.34 线升级至 v2.34.2。升级地址：https://github.com/coder/coder/releases。若暂时无法升级，可在反向代理（如 Nginx）层面限制请求体大小（client_max_body_size 100M），并限制文件上传权限仅对可信用户开放，或在防火墙层面限制 /api/v2/files 接口访问频率作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25877","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-2mg2-p7r7-g27f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55078.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55078.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7cbd46ac4e2574be115c8b4e081aab80c1276132/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55078.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51d0c9e0ce11ffd48a06c5251961beaf423d7c9a/content/posts/cve-2026-55078.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55078.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/49e980b0fa2abb924c0c6216ee3d787ba6a54723/data/osv/GO-2026-5916.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-2mg2-p7r7-g27f/GHSA-2mg2-p7r7-g27f.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55078.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/slowslowgogo/SecurityReport/blob/9c2fe25b94c7c3f24908c5b82631ca477488eb4f/output/brief_2026-07-08.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0592.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0591","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0591.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55077","title":"Coder Coder 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Coder 远程开发环境平台存在权限提升漏洞（CVE-2026-55077）。漏洞存在于 `PUT /api/v2/users/{user}/password` 端点，该端点仅授权 `ActionUpdatePersonal` 权限，未阻止 `user-admin` 角色重置 `owner` 账户密码，且管理员重置他人密码时无需验证当前密码。攻击者需拥有 `user-admin` 权限，可利用此漏洞重置任意 `owner` 账户密码，进而以所有者身份登录并完全控制部署环境，包括模板、工作区、许可证、组织设置及自行提升为 `owner` 角色，实现从 `user-admin` 到 `owner` 的权限提升。影响 Coder 2.29.7、2.32.7、2.33.8、2.34.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.2（HIGH），攻击向量网络、低复杂度、高权限、无需用户交互、机密性/完整性/可用性均高影响。官方已在 v2.29.17、v2.32.7、v2.33.8、v2.34.2 修复，建议升级至修复版本或限制 `user-admin` 角色仅授予可信管理员。CVE 编号：CVE-2026-55077，CWE-285（不当授权）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55077","GHSA-29xf-69gq-m9jx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T23:16:55Z","updated":"2026-07-09T16:16:44Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Coder 到对应受支持版本：2.34 系列升级至 v2.34.2，2.33 系列升级至 v2.33.8，2.32 系列升级至 v2.32.7，2.29 ESR 系列升级至 v2.29.17。升级前可暂时将 user-admin 角色限制为仅受信任管理员分配，防止低权限管理员越权重置 owner 账户密码。升级后该漏洞将被修复，非 owner 用户无法再重置 owner 角色账户的密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25709","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-29xf-69gq-m9jx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55077.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55077.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7cbd46ac4e2574be115c8b4e081aab80c1276132/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55077.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-07/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55077.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51d0c9e0ce11ffd48a06c5251961beaf423d7c9a/content/posts/cve-2026-55077.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55077.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/ff41f1eb3993c8f2b283d38fa9b7c1734e5eda70/data/reports/GO-2026-5906.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/2e7c6b9fec9028dbc8f2daa84da0831eed0892d0/posts/cve-2026-55077-go-github-com-coder-coder-v2.html","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/fc6a1124d3138addd694c22c99bb3a008ab167a6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-55077-coder-allows-organizations-to-provision-remote-development-environments-via-terraform.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2e2ab4687e3840d3ae537224ca3dbe9e3c1067/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-29xf-69gq-m9jx/GHSA-29xf-69gq-m9jx.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0591.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0590","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0590.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55076","title":"Coder OIDC 邮箱验证类型强制跳过认证触发账户接管漏洞","description":"Coder OIDC 认证回调处理中存在类型断言缺陷，直接使用 Go `bool` 类型断言检查 `email_verified` 声明。当身份提供商（IdP）返回非布尔类型（如字符串 `\"false\"`）或省略该声明时，断言失败却采取了开放策略，导致未验证的邮箱被视为已验证。结合无条件的邮箱回退关联机制，攻击者可在兼容的 IdP 注册受害者邮箱但不验证，随后通过 OIDC 登录并匹配到受害者现有的 Coder 账户，实现无需前置认证的完整账户接管。该漏洞影响 Coder 2.29.7、2.32.7、2.33.8、2.34.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.4（HIGH）。官方已在上述版本中修复，强制对 `email_verified` 进行跨类型强制转换（fail-closed）并阻止已关联不同 IdP 主体用户的邮箱回退。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55076","GHSA-75vm-6w67-gwvp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T23:16:55Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:46:04Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Coder 到对应修复版本：2.34.x 升级至 v2.34.2，2.33.x 升级至 v2.33.8，2.32.x 升级至 v2.32.7，2.29.x (ESR) 升级至 v2.29.17。作为临时缓解，确保 IdP 返回的 email_verified 为原生 JSON 布尔类型（非字符串 \"false\"），但邮箱回退关联问题无配置层面缓解方案，必须升级修复。参考修复 PR：#25712、#25713。升级地址：https://github.com/coder/coder/releases","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25712","https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25713","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-75vm-6w67-gwvp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55076.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55076.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-07/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55076.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/59370880a06b381c063ab200d3efef5016493e80/app/routes/posts/2026-07-08_CVE-2026-55076.mdx","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55076.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55076.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5907.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/edede9b71fa990a77c952d30aca6dbc819af3383/posts/cve-2026-55076-go-github-com-coder-coder-v2.html","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-07-08_zh.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2e2ab4687e3840d3ae537224ca3dbe9e3c1067/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-75vm-6w67-gwvp/GHSA-75vm-6w67-gwvp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0590.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0589","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0589.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55075","title":"Coder Coder OIDC 登录账户接管漏洞","description":"Coder OIDC 登录存在两个链式缺陷导致账户接管漏洞：邮箱回退关联未校验既有 IdP subject 关联，且 email_verified 声明仅在显式为布尔 false 时才校验，缺失或非布尔值均被视为已验证。攻击者若能在配置的 OIDC 提供商处注册或控制与受害者 Coder 账户相同邮箱，且受害者账户未关联不同的 IdP subject，即可伪造认证登录为受害者，完全接管其工作区、模板及资源。影响 Coder 2.29.7、2.32.7、2.33.8、2.34.2 之前版本，CVSS 7.4 高危。官方已在 2.29.17、2.32.7、2.33.8、2.34.2 版本修复，限制邮箱回退仅用于首次及遗留关联，并将缺失或类型异常的 email_claimed 默认为 false。缓解措施为配置 OIDC 提供商禁止自注册或强制邮箱验证后再签发令牌。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55075","GHSA-9r87-mvcw-x35f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T22:16:53Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:46:56Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Coder 到对应修复版本：2.34 线升级至 v2.34.2，2.33 线升级至 v2.33.8，2.32 线升级至 v2.32.7，2.29 ESR 线升级至 v2.29.17。升级参考：https://github.com/coder/coder/releases。无法立即升级时，配置 OIDC 提供商禁止自助注册并强制要求 email_verified 为 true 后再签发 token，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25712","https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/25713","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.29.17","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-9r87-mvcw-x35f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55075.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12ccf92eecf2db493c63630fd06d8245f1d02476/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55075.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55075.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55075.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55075.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-07/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55075.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/afbf506b1b816f3e214d7dbd451d8627ce430c7a/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-550xx/CVE-2026-55075.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55075.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51d0c9e0ce11ffd48a06c5251961beaf423d7c9a/content/posts/cve-2026-55075.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c141ac26af069a62a3853624cd1f5700d4c925dc/2026/CVE-2026-55075.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0589.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0608","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55434","title":"Coder AI Bridge provider 接口未限制请求体大小导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Coder AI Bridge 提供程序端点未对请求体大小进行限制，存在拒绝服务漏洞。具有 AI Bridge 访问权限的认证用户可通过向 `/api/v2/aibridge/anthropic/v1/messages` 等端点发送超大的请求体或分块数据，导致 `io.ReadAll` 无限制读取并耗尽堆内存，进而使操作系统终止进程。由于 AI Bridge 与 `coderd` 运行在同一进程中，此漏洞会导致整个控制平面崩溃，包括 API、工作区协调器和 DERP 中继服务。该漏洞影响 Coder v2.33.0 至 v2.33.7 及 v2.34.0 至 v2.34.1 版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。厂商已在 v2.33.8 和 v2.34.2 版本中通过引入 `http.MaxBytesReader` 限制请求体大小进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55434","GHSA-f5vp-w269-392g"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T21:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-08T19:47:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至 v2.33.8（2.33 系列）或 v2.34.2（2.34 系列），这两个版本已在 AI Bridge provider 端点中通过 `http.MaxBytesReader` 限制请求体大小。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 AI Bridge 功能（`CODER_EXPERIMENTAL_AI_BRIDGE=false`）或通过反向代理层（如 Nginx）对 `/api/v2/aibridge/` 路径设置请求体大小上限（如 `client_max_body_size 1m`）作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26164","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-f5vp-w269-392g","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55434.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a2c62c60ff1862a166bb0b583b0e40e8effbf660/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55434.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55434.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/ef3dc9430f65ce0192f2cbd3157225a5da8707d7/content/posts/cve-2026-55434.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55434.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/osv/GO-2026-5921.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-f5vp-w269-392g/GHSA-f5vp-w269-392g.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d5b2a1dce9c7e458934cecfd52fe64aaa62e247/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55434.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/1f0b4d834689f794b1d2ed00137cff546bba1cbe/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-20801.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/fc6e0c34c155b9f85482e51e3a802cb311e52009/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-554xx/CVE-2026-55434.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0446","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0446.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53935","title":"Cilium CiliumLocalRedirectPolicy 跨命名空间服务流量劫持漏洞","description":"Cilium 网络组件中的 CiliumLocalRedirectPolicy 存在授权校验缺陷（CWE-863），具有创建本地重定向策略权限的用户可通过 addressMatcher 指定任意 ClusterIP，从而劫持任意命名空间中 Service 的流量，绕过 serviceMatcher 提供的命名空间隔离保证。此外，删除此类恶意策略会破坏 Cilium 内部服务状态，导致受影响 Service 的服务翻译功能完全失效。该漏洞影响 Cilium v1.19.0 至 v1.19.3、v1.18.2 至 v1.18.9 以及 v1.17.16 之前的所有版本，攻击者需具备相邻网络访问能力及较高权限，CVSS 评分 6.9，危害等级中危。Cilium 社区已在 v1.19.4、v1.18.10 和 v1.17.16 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53935","GHSA-q6h5-q3q6-f87x"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T21:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-10T17:56:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cilium 至 v1.17.16、v1.18.10 或 v1.19.4 及以上版本。该漏洞无临时缓解措施，必须通过升级修复。升级前请确认 CiliumLocalRedirectPolicy 配置，升级后重启 Cilium agent 使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cilium/cilium/commit/81d446395673dc2c684c047c12715caffac1a351","https://github.com/cilium/cilium/commit/92ca32eda85aa0c7611c28221cc26fa08be17ebc","https://github.com/cilium/cilium/commit/fe7eb53c7aac9fa7ec610b1975d73fbbb198c66d","https://github.com/cilium/cilium/pull/45412","https://github.com/cilium/cilium/pull/45584","https://github.com/cilium/cilium/pull/45585","https://github.com/cilium/cilium/security/advisories/GHSA-q6h5-q3q6-f87x","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53935.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/cilium/cilium/CVE-2026-53935.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53935.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-53935.md","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/296c48a07bd7bce719fb77308241a1ee212cb242/osv/cilium-clustermesh-apiserver/CVE-2026-53935.json.sha256","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-53935.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2026-5914.json","https://github.com/deckhouse/virtualization/blob/15a464ec66ac3727725c598cd32fe8c8e190d0d8/CHANGELOG/CHANGELOG-v1.8.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-q6h5-q3q6-f87x/GHSA-q6h5-q3q6-f87x.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/20783e837c8d3900447582f2695481bf39f8f7ff/data/2026/CVE-2026-53935.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0446.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0312","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49471","title":"Serena Web Dashboard DNS 重绑定远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Serena MCP 工具包内置的 Web 仪表板在固定端口（TCP 24282）上运行未经验证的 Flask API，缺乏认证、CSRF 保护和 Host 头校验。攻击者可通过 DNS 重绑定攻击，诱使用户在运行 Serena 时访问恶意网页，使浏览器将同源请求重定向至本地仪表板，进而向代理的持久化内存存储写入任意内容。结合默认启用的 `execute_shell_command`（`shell=True`）功能，代理在读取被污染的内存后会自动执行恶意命令，形成完整的远程代码执行链。该漏洞影响 v1.5.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.3，危害等级高。官方已在 v1.5.2 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49471","GHSA-37h2-6p4f-mp3q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T21:17:25Z","updated":"2026-07-20T14:54:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 Serena 至 v1.5.2 或更高版本，该版本在仪表板中增加了身份验证、CSRF 保护和 Host 头校验。如无法立即升级，可在 `config.yml` 中将 `web_dashboard` 设为 `false` 以禁用内置 Web 仪表板，或在防火墙中阻止对 TCP 端口 24282 的外部访问，并确保浏览器不访问运行 Serena 的本地地址。同时建议审查并移除所有默认 context 配置中 `shell=True` 的调用，改用 `shell=False` 并传递参数列表形式执行命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/oraios/serena/commit/016ccbe1c095a3eed7967737ac1d4df2754f5d96","https://github.com/oraios/serena/releases/tag/v1.5.2","https://github.com/oraios/serena/security/advisories/GHSA-37h2-6p4f-mp3q","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49471.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49471.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4d1eebacb731643a646e28a4f60e64dd753a5ff4/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-49471.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/serena-agent/CVE-2026-49471.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49471.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-07/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49471.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49471.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/835070fbd6ecba04552e1532c7073330c40ea694/posts/cve-2026-49471-pip-serena-agent.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-37h2-6p4f-mp3q/GHSA-37h2-6p4f-mp3q.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/cba1106e73e57152f6afbb7764cd551d404f7b74/vulns/serena-agent/PYSEC-2026-3061.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0312.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0609","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55435","title":"Coder AI Bridge 授权校验缺陷漏洞","description":"Coder AI Bridge 代理端点存在授权校验缺陷（CWE-863），`coderd/aibridgedserver` 中的 `Server.IsAuthorized` 方法在验证 API 密钥时仅检查密钥格式、过期时间、密钥密文以及已删除或系统用户状态，但未校验用户账户是否处于暂停（suspended）状态。由于暂停操作不会自动吊销已签发的 API 密钥，被暂停用户的未过期令牌仍可继续调用 AI Bridge LLM 代理端点，消耗部署环境计费的付费提供商资源。攻击条件为拥有有效长期令牌的已暂停用户，影响 Coder v2.30.0 至 v2.32.6、v2.33.0 至 v2.33.7、v2.34.0 至 v2.34.1 版本。官方已在 v2.32.7、v2.33.8、v2.34.2 中修复，临时措施为暂停用户时通过 `DELETE /api/v2/users/{user}/keys` 手动删除其 API 密钥。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55435","GHSA-wqxv-w64v-5wh6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-07T19:16:54Z","updated":"2026-07-09T16:16:44Z","remediation":"立即升级 Coder 至 v2.34.2/v2.33.8/v2.32.7 或更高版本，该修复在 AI Bridge 授权中增加了对非活跃用户的检查。如无法立即升级，在暂停用户后立即通过 `DELETE /api/v2/users/{user}/keys` 接口删除其 API 密钥，防止已签发令牌继续使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/coder/coder/commit/0d2c9f904a8b75b888140fcc8fbf4633660cc787","https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26164","https://github.com/coder/coder/pull/26173","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.32.7","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.33.8","https://github.com/coder/coder/releases/tag/v2.34.2","https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-wqxv-w64v-5wh6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55435.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-55435.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a2c62c60ff1862a166bb0b583b0e40e8effbf660/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55435.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/coder/coder/v2/CVE-2026-55435.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/ef3dc9430f65ce0192f2cbd3157225a5da8707d7/content/posts/cve-2026-55435.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55435.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/7f04fb463deb2e42d892e6f9165c6eaca2feb1b6/data/reports/GO-2026-5925.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wqxv-w64v-5wh6/GHSA-wqxv-w64v-5wh6.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d5b2a1dce9c7e458934cecfd52fe64aaa62e247/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55435.json","https://github.com/midnightconman/go_vulndb/blob/d993e2e5e84dd30ceb1958dc17e25f002fffd6f7/ID/GO-2026-5925.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0623","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0623.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55574","title":"vLLM 正则表达式拒绝服务漏洞","description":"vLLM 是一款高吞吐量、内存高效的大语言模型推理引擎，其 structured_outputs.regex API 参数将用户提供的正则表达式字符串直接传递给语法编译器后端，且未设置编译超时。在 xgrammar 后端中，字符串直接进入 compile_regex() 函数而无任何防护；在 outlines 后端中，validate_regex_is_buildable() 仅检查前瞻断言、反向引用等结构性问题，但未进行复杂度分析，因此包含嵌套量词（如 (a+)+b）的恶意正则表达式可通过所有校验，导致 DFA 状态空间呈指数级膨胀。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需发送一个包含此类对抗性正则表达式的请求，即可使推理工作线程无限期挂起，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 vLLM 0.24.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。官方已在 v0.24.0 版本中通过为编译调用添加超时机制修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55574","GHSA-rwxx-mrjm-wc2m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T21:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-07T19:03:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 vLLM 至 0.24.0 或更高版本，该版本在 regex 编译调用（compile_regex 和 oc.Index）中引入了线程超时机制（建议设为 5 秒）。如无法升级，可在反向代理层对 /v1/chat/completions 等接口的 structured_outputs.regex 参数实施长度限制（建议 ≤512 字符）并配置请求超时，同时禁用 outlines 和 xgrammar 后端的 regex 功能作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/2b3006076c5e9bc4cda9e03e3641388de3c5c286","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45118","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/security/advisories/GHSA-rwxx-mrjm-wc2m","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln/vllm/CVE-2026-55574.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln_en/vllm/CVE-2026-55574.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55574.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55574.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55574.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-55574.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55574.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55574.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/f0f2c9542dcdee0dfc1c400f44c7b913768e2195/pkgs/development/python-modules/vllm/default.nix","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/vllm/CVE-2026-55574.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0623.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0623.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0622","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0622.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55514","title":"vLLM M-RoPE模型提示嵌入拒绝服务漏洞","description":"vLLM 0.12.0 至 0.24.0 之前版本中存在可达断言漏洞（CWE-617），位于 GPUModelRunner 的 _init_mrope_positions 方法中。当攻击者向 /v1/completions 端点发送仅包含 prompt_embeds 的请求且使用 M-RoPE（多维旋转位置编码）模型时，EngineCore 中的断言 assert req_state.prompt_token_ids is not None 失败，导致进程致命崩溃，整个服务器应用关闭。任何有权访问 /v1/completions 端点的远程用户均可构造特制 JSON 请求触发此拒绝服务攻击，无需额外前置条件。该漏洞影响所有使用 M-RoPE 模型的 vLLM 部署，已在 0.24.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55514","GHSA-33cg-gxv8-3p8g"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T21:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-07T19:02:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 vLLM 至 0.24.0 或更高版本（含修复 commit 470229c3）。如无法立即升级，在启动服务时移除 `--enable-prompt-embeds` 参数，或通过反向代理限制 `/v1/completions` 端点仅允许受信用户访问，避免未授权远程用户发送纯 prompt_embeds 载荷触发断言崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/470229c37efaf69c86e8bc97482b0b1ff7551c65","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45252","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/tag/v0.24.0","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/security/advisories/GHSA-33cg-gxv8-3p8g","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln/vllm/CVE-2026-55514.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln_en/vllm/CVE-2026-55514.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55514.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55514.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55514.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-55514.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55514.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55514.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/e2dc9b10b4294fec311100ff3fb27e92f3e38b07/pkgs/development/python-modules/vllm/default.nix","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/vllm/CVE-2026-55514.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0622.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0622.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0622.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0499","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0499.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54234","title":"vLLM vLLM 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"vLLM 大语言模型推理引擎的推测性解码（speculative decoding）状态处理存在输入验证缺陷。在合法的多请求推测性解码工作负载中，拒绝采样器可能生成等于模型词汇表大小边界值（vocab_size=151936）的恢复令牌，该越界值在引擎选择下一个有效令牌时被转换为 -1 并写入推测解码器的输入 ID 序列中。模型嵌入层和注意力路径随后消费该无效令牌，触发 GPU 设备端断言失败（CUDA device-side assert），导致引擎工作进程崩溃。远程攻击者可通过公开的 gRPC Generate 和 Abort 端点发送特定的重叠请求序列触发此漏洞，造成服务拒绝服务（DoS），中断所有并发请求，直至工作进程重启。该漏洞影响 vLLM 0.24.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 0.24.0 版本中通过修复令牌边界检查逻辑完成修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54234","GHSA-8wr5-jm2h-8r4f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T21:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-07T19:04:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 vLLM 至 0.24.0 或更高版本（对应 commit 8a5cf1ccd65e8ac7635c402c1ec0b08988bc26ca），该版本已修复推测解码中恢复令牌越界导致 GPU 断言的缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在部署层面禁用公共 gRPC Generate/Abort 端点的外部访问，或限制推测解码（speculative decoding）功能的使用作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/8a5cf1ccd65e8ac7635c402c1ec0b08988bc26ca","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44744","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/security/advisories/GHSA-8wr5-jm2h-8r4f","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/45fa3110991b1e32f1dbd5486d359b38b77d645b/data/vuln/vllm/CVE-2026-54234.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54234.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54234.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/886e3cd9cda40e2c4ffda31042908f1a83f89624/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-54234.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/988307fd6b2981b969f4b50ca32c9037837d1dce/pkgs/development/python-modules/vllm/default.nix","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/vllm/CVE-2026-54234.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54234.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-06/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54234.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54234.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/289454b1705420b325f7615708efca878371bd29/cve/CVE-2026-54234.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0499.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0499.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0630","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0630.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55646","title":"vLLM 语音转文本API 资源消耗漏洞","description":"vLLM 是一款用于大语言模型的推理和服务引擎，其语音转文本 API（/v1/audio/transcriptions 和 /v1/audio/translations）在处理上传的音频文件时存在安全缺陷。vLLM 文档中声明了 VLLM_MAX_AUDIO_CLIP_FILESIZE_MB 参数（默认 25MB）用于限制音频文件大小，但实际实现中，路由处理函数在检查该压缩文件大小限制之前，先通过 request.file.read() 将整个上传文件完整读入内存。攻击者只需能够访问该 API 端点（包括需要 API 密钥的场景），即可通过提交超大的 multipart 上传文件，使 vLLM 在拒绝请求之前就已分配与上传文件大小成比例的内存，导致内存压力增大，甚至在高并发场景下触发进程被 OOM 终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 vLLM 0.22.0 至 0.23.0 版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等，属于 CWE-400 未受控的资源消耗问题。修复版本为 0.24.0，建议用户及时升级。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55646","GHSA-v82g-2437-67m2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-06T20:16:37Z","updated":"2026-07-07T19:04:45Z","remediation":"升级 vLLM 至 0.24.0 或更高版本，该版本在读取上传文件前强制执行 VLLM_MAX_AUDIO_CLIP_FILESIZE_MB 压缩音频大小限制。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 ASGI 层（如 Nginx 的 client_max_body_size）设置请求体大小上限，限制音频上传端点 `/v1/audio/transcriptions` 和 `/v1/audio/translations` 的请求体不超过 25MB，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/b997071ec493765abbed990c65843ed05e4708a8","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45510","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/security/advisories/GHSA-v82g-2437-67m2","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln/vllm/CVE-2026-55646.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln_en/vllm/CVE-2026-55646.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55646.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55646.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55646.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-55646.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55646.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-55646.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55646.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55646.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0630.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0630.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0630.toml"}]